<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>OBSERVOR™ 2.0 — Trial Recorder</title>
<style>
:root{color-scheme:dark;--bg:#090909;--panel:#141414;--line:#303030;--text:#eee;--muted:#aaa;--gold:#c9a85c}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font:15px/1.5 system-ui,Segoe UI,sans-serif}
main{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:28px}h1{color:var(--gold);letter-spacing:.08em}h2{font-size:18px;margin:0 0 12px}.lede{color:var(--muted);max-width:850px}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px;margin-top:18px}.panel{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:18px}.full{grid-column:1/-1}
label{display:block;color:var(--muted);margin:10px 0 5px}input,select,textarea,button{font:inherit}input,select,textarea{width:100%;background:#0d0d0d;color:var(--text);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;padding:9px}textarea{min-height:68px;resize:vertical}
button{background:#202020;color:var(--text);border:1px solid #444;border-radius:7px;padding:9px 13px;cursor:pointer}button:hover{border-color:var(--gold)}button.primary{border-color:var(--gold);color:var(--gold)}button:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:not-allowed}
.row{display:flex;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center}.status{padding:10px;border-left:3px solid var(--gold);background:#101010;color:var(--muted);margin-top:12px}
pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;max-height:300px;overflow:auto;background:#0b0b0b;padding:12px;border-radius:7px;color:#ccc}.note{color:#dfc47f}.condition{border-top:1px solid #333;margin-top:12px;padding-top:8px}
@media(max-width:760px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.full{grid-column:auto}}
</style>
</head>
<body><main>
<h1>OBSERVOR™ 2.0</h1>
<p class="lede"><strong>Phenomenon before identity.</strong> Record observable behavior, preserve condition distinctions, and keep interpretation separate from raw records. This recorder does not calculate an identity score.</p>
<div class="status note">Development recorder · Browser memory only until JSON export · No server submission or remote telemetry. Do not use real participant data until the study protocol, consent, privacy, and data-handling procedures are approved.</div>
<div class="grid">
<section class="panel">
<h2>1 — Study protocol</h2>
<label>Study ID</label><input id="study" placeholder="Study identifier">
<label>Protocol version</label><input id="version" placeholder="e.g. 1.0">
<label>Research question</label><textarea id="question"></textarea>
<label>Candidate property (not presumed established)</label><input id="candidate">
<label>Operational definition of history</label><textarea id="history"></textarea>
<label>Experimental unit</label><input id="unit" placeholder="Define what one experimental unit is">
<label>Task ID / version</label><div class="row"><input id="taskId" placeholder="Task ID"><input id="taskVersion" placeholder="Version"></div>
<label>Task description and response format</label><textarea id="taskDesc"></textarea><input id="responseFormat" placeholder="Response format, e.g. text description / choice code">
<label>Perturbation ID / version</label><div class="row"><input id="perturbId" placeholder="Perturbation ID"><input id="perturbVersion" placeholder="Version"></div>
<label>Perturbation description</label><textarea id="perturbDesc"></textarea>
</section>
<section class="panel">
<h2>2 — Condition procedures</h2>
<p class="note">Define each procedure for this study. The software does not invent or perform the manipulation.</p>
<div class="condition"><strong>H+</strong><label>Procedure ID</label><input id="pid0" placeholder="H+ procedure identifier"><label>Procedure description</label><textarea id="proc0"></textarea></div><div class="condition"><strong>H−</strong><label>Procedure ID</label><input id="pid1" placeholder="H− procedure identifier"><label>Procedure description</label><textarea id="proc1"></textarea></div><div class="condition"><strong>H−I</strong><label>Procedure ID</label><input id="pid2" placeholder="H−I procedure identifier"><label>Procedure description</label><textarea id="proc2"></textarea></div><div class="condition"><strong>SHAM</strong><label>Procedure ID</label><input id="pid3" placeholder="SHAM procedure identifier"><label>Procedure description</label><textarea id="proc3"></textarea></div>
</section>
<section class="panel">
<h2>3 — Session</h2>
<label>Participant ID</label><input id="participant" placeholder="Participant identifier">
<div class="row" style="margin-top:12px"><button class="primary" id="openSession">Validate protocol &amp; open session</button></div>
<div class="status" id="sessionInfo">No session open.</div>
<pre id="errors">Protocol validation messages appear here.</pre>
</section>
<section class="panel">
<h2>4 — Trial recorder</h2>
<label>Assigned condition</label><select id="condition"><option>H+</option><option>H−</option><option>H−I</option><option>SHAM</option></select>
<label>Manipulation status</label><select id="manipulationStatus"><option value="unverifiable">Unverifiable / external procedure</option><option value="not_attempted">Not attempted</option><option value="completed_as_specified">Completed as specified (operator attests)</option><option value="partial">Partial</option><option value="failed">Failed</option></select>
<label>Evidence / manipulation check</label><textarea id="manipulationEvidence"></textarea>
<label>Deviation</label><textarea id="deviation"></textarea>
<div class="row"><button class="primary" id="begin" disabled>Begin trial</button><button id="capture" disabled>Capture observation &amp; complete</button></div>
<div class="status" id="activeInfo">No active trial.</div>
<label>Raw observation / response</label><textarea id="observation" placeholder="Enter the observation specified by the task protocol."></textarea>
<label>Abort reason (if needed)</label><input id="abortReason" placeholder="Reason for abort">
<button id="abort" disabled>Abort and retain trial</button>
</section>
<section class="panel full">
<h2>5 — Session records</h2>
<p class="note">All four conditions remain separate. No pooled history index, persistence score, or inferential comparison is calculated here.</p>
<div class="row"><button id="export" disabled>Export complete session JSON</button></div>
<pre id="trialList">No trials recorded.</pre>
</section>
</div>
<script type="module" src="/observor-assets/js/recorder.js"></script>
</main></body></html>